\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Trust contract}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}
\tag{provenance}

\p{A \strong{trust contract} #{\mathsf{Trust}(P)} is a predicate requiring
the protocol to respect declared provenance, information, and accounting
boundaries. At minimum it specifies evaluation independence, behavior-policy
stamps for reused rollouts, environment and verifier versions, and complete
lifecycle-cost reporting.}

\p{The predicate is evidence to be checked. It is not a statement that a
protocol is safe, aligned, or free from distribution shift.}
